Weird party.

19
00:02:19,246 --> 00:02:20,480
Hmph!

20
00:02:25,953 --> 00:02:30,257
♪♪

21
00:02:32,826 --> 00:02:34,227
Tommy Dunn, you big stud!

22
00:03:10,430 --> 00:03:12,399
Yeah, you all right, mate?

23
