Tommy, it's Nick.
Nick Reagan calling.

45
00:05:19,659 --> 00:05:21,628
Long time, bud.

46
00:05:21,661 --> 00:05:24,932
Listen. I'm not calling
with great news.

47
00:05:24,965 --> 00:05:28,468
It's about Chang.

48
00:05:28,501 --> 00:05:29,602
I know you won't
come home, mate,

49
00:05:29,636 --> 00:05:31,238
