at least want to know.

50
00:05:31,271 --> 00:05:33,073
The funeral's on Monday.

51
00:05:34,341 --> 00:05:35,608
Hut!

52
00:05:53,660 --> 00:05:57,264
♪ And a long way down

53
00:06:04,171 --> 00:06:07,640
♪ It's a long way out

54
00:06:14,514 --> 00:06:19,386
♪ And a long

55
00:06:19,419 --> 00:06:21,154
♪ Way down

56
