We need to get this done.

57
00:06:29,029 --> 00:06:30,930
Just one moment, all right?

58
00:06:33,366 --> 00:06:35,268
Ah, here he is.

59
00:06:37,770 --> 00:06:40,107
Yeah, he made it right on time.

60
00:06:43,576 --> 00:06:46,179
Sorry, mates.
I didn't have any lunch.

61
00:06:46,213 --> 00:06:48,281
Okay, let's get this over with.

62
00:07:01,328 --> 00:07:03,330
Done deal.

63
00:07:03,363 --> 00:07:06,433
Right.

64
00:07:06,466 --> 00:07:08,068
Fifteen minutes stretching.

65
00:07:08,101 --> 00:07:10,570
Then I want to see
some real intensity out there.

66
00:07:10,603 --> 00:07:13,340
Flat-out tonight, boys.
Short and sharp.

67
00:07:13,373 --> 00:07:14,641
