68
00:07:14,674 --> 00:07:17,677
So it's not too late
to make changes.

69
00:07:17,710 --> 00:07:19,546
Stretch it out!

70
00:07:19,579 --> 00:07:22,449
It's more attitude
I'm concerned of.

71
00:07:30,690 --> 00:07:32,559
What's he doing?

72
00:07:34,061 --> 00:07:35,295
Tommy!

73
00:07:40,133 --> 00:07:42,502
When you were a young fella,

74
00:07:42,535 --> 00:07:46,806
I seem to remember you
being rather inspired...

75
00:07:46,839 --> 00:07:51,144
By a certain AFL player's
words of wisdom.

76
00:07:51,178 --> 00:07:53,480
Gospel from
the famous old Chang.

77
00:07:53,513 --> 00:07:55,582
Time to pass the baton,
isn't it?

78
00:07:57,417 --> 00:08:01,288
Attitude and giving
your absolute best.

79
00:08:01,754 --> 00:08:05,058
You might wanna talk to them...

80
00:08:05,092 --> 00:08:07,694
About that.

81
00:08:07,727 --> 00:08:09,329
Eh?

82
00:08:12,499 --> 00:08:14,201
You too!

83
00:08:16,269 --> 00:08:17,637
Let's see some football.

84
00:08:55,675 --> 00:08:56,743
Slow down.

85
00:09:00,380 --> 00:09:02,382
Hi, Sammy!

86
00:09:05,518 --> 00:09:06,753
Come on, boys!

87
00:09:06,786 --> 00:09:09,456
Hey, don't!
Don't! Come on!

88
00:09:09,489 --> 00:09:11,458
Stop stuffin' around, Tommy.

89
00:09:11,491 --> 00:09:13,160
Oh, Jesus.

90
00:09:24,737 --> 00:09:27,207
- That was a good catch.
- Mark.

91
00:09:31,378 --> 00:09:33,246
He seems... good.

92
00:09:34,581 --> 00:09:37,384
Morts will probably take
the BNF this year.

93
00:09:40,387 --> 00:09:42,222
BNF?

94
00:09:42,255 --> 00:09:44,424
Best and fairest.

95
00:09:47,294 --> 00:09:50,230
What about him?
Is he a good player?

96
00:09:50,263 --> 00:09:52,865
You don't normally watch.
You hate footy.

97
00:09:52,899 --> 00:09:55,134
I don't hate it.

98
00:10:04,477 --> 00:10:07,814
- Hey, Tommy.
- Hey. Hi.

99
00:10:07,847 --> 00:10:11,351
- Where will you be playing?
- In the middle. Where else?

100
00:10:11,384 --> 00:10:14,754
- Cool.
- Are you coming to the beach?

101
00:10:14,787 --> 00:10:17,490
- You heading down?
- Yeah. Bring the girls.

102
00:10:17,524 --> 00:10:18,958
- I will.
- All right. See you there.

103
00:10:18,991 --> 00:10:21,328
See you there. Bye, Tommy.

104
00:10:26,433 --> 00:10:29,669
- Is that his girlfriend?
- Doubt it.

105
00:10:29,702 --> 00:10:32,405
Anyway, he's gotta concentrate
on his training.

106
00:10:32,439 --> 00:10:34,274
Oh, I'm sure he can multitask.

107
00:10:34,307 --> 00:10:37,310
Julie doesn't
even understand the game.

108
00:10:37,344 --> 00:10:39,879
Come on, Chicken Licken.
Dad'll be waiting.

109
00:10:39,912 --> 00:10:41,681
Dad'll be drunk.

110
00:10:43,483 --> 00:10:46,753
Please refrain from addressing
me as "Chicken Licken."

111
00:10:54,561 --> 00:10:57,330
I just don't get
why it's so hard.

112
00:10:57,364 --> 00:10:58,898
Well, have you
ever tried it, Irish?

113
00:10:58,931 --> 00:11:02,535
What's to try? You just bounce
the ball straight up in the air.

114
00:11:02,569 --> 00:11:05,238
- Let's see you do it then.
- All right.

115
00:11:06,406 --> 00:11:08,675
Oh! Fuck!

116
00:11:08,708 --> 00:11:12,512
- My fuckin' nose!
- Irish, you idiot.

117
00:11:12,545 --> 00:11:14,514
Dangerous, Australia.

118
00:11:32,532 --> 00:11:34,501
Hey, I got Dad
to give me the day off.

119
00:11:34,534 --> 00:11:36,569
Might go to the Grand Final.

120
00:11:36,603 --> 00:11:38,571
Can you get me into
the social club after?

121
00:11:38,605 --> 00:11:40,807
- What do you think?
- I'm almost 15.

122
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:42,409
Exactly.

123
00:11:42,442 --> 00:11:44,977
Samantha!

124
00:11:45,011 --> 00:11:48,481
Did you put a glass bottle
of Coke in the freezer?

125
00:11:49,582 --> 00:11:51,751
Did you?

126
00:11:51,784 --> 00:11:54,321
Run to the gift store
and see if Janet needs a hand.

127
00:11:55,788 --> 00:11:57,256
It was me, Dad.

128
00:11:57,990 --> 00:11:59,392
Look!

129
00:11:59,426 --> 00:12:01,361
I'll clean it up.

130
00:12:09,502 --> 00:12:10,937
Fuckin' nose.

131
00:12:13,506 --> 00:12:15,875
Okay, boys,
selection's in half an hour.

132
00:12:15,908 --> 00:12:18,845
So hurry it up, eh?
That means you, Franky.

133
00:12:18,878 --> 00:12:20,913
No worries, mate.
What do you think?

134
00:12:20,947 --> 00:12:23,616
AFL scouts will be
down there on Saturday.

135
00:12:23,650 --> 00:12:25,852
Franky, you're 25.

136
00:12:25,885 --> 00:12:28,855
Yeah. Mature age.
Happens all the time.

137
00:12:28,888 --> 00:12:31,424
Yeah, to dudes with talent.

138
00:12:31,458 --> 00:12:32,792
Well, who's the leading
goal scorer

139
00:12:32,825 --> 00:12:34,394
In the Bellarine League
this year?

140
00:12:34,427 --> 00:12:36,463
Uh, Davies at Ocean Grove.

141
00:12:36,496 --> 00:12:38,531
All right.
Well, after him?

142
00:12:38,565 --> 00:12:40,367
Selwood at Anglesea.

143
00:12:43,370 --> 00:12:45,438
And next?

144
00:12:45,472 --> 00:12:47,106
That'd be you, Frank.

145
00:12:47,139 --> 00:12:49,342
Top three. Point taken.

146
00:12:50,843 --> 00:12:53,580
- I think you mean "point made"
- Exactly.

147
00:12:53,613 --> 00:12:55,915
Can't we just worry
about winning this Saturday?

148
00:12:55,948 --> 00:12:57,584
Yeah, well, the Final...

149
00:12:57,617 --> 00:12:59,752
Aah! My balls are on fire!

150
