01:40:04,153 --> 01:40:06,789
Don't center up until you
hit the half-forward flank,

1532
01:40:06,823 --> 01:40:10,326
And then send it through
to Scotty Hyde all day long.

1533
01:40:10,359 --> 01:40:12,795
Those bastards
haven't got the legs.

1534
01:40:12,829 --> 01:40:14,631
- Are you up for it?
- Yes!

1535
01:40:14,664 --> 01:40:15,932
Grab a jumper!

1536
01:40:15,965 --> 01:40:17,734
- Come on, get in.
- Listen up, boys.

1537
01:40:17,767 --> 01:40:19,602
I know some of you
are hurting,

1538
01:40:19,636 --> 01:40:21,370
But when you walk off the Grand
in 30 minutes time

1539
01:40:21,403 --> 01:40:23,139
Holding a Premiership cup,

1540
01:40:23,172 --> 01:40:26,108
You'll remember this day
for the rest of your lives.

1541
01:40:26,142 --> 01:40:29,712
Success today is about
giving your best.

1542
01:40:29,746 --> 01:40:32,148
Commit to that,
and you'll walk tall

1543
01:40:32,181 --> 01:40:34,684
No matter where you are, okay?

1544
01:40:34,717 --> 01:40:37,386
Now, today is about
bleeding for your teammates

1545
01:40:37,419 --> 01:40:39,255
For 30 more minutes.

1546
01:40:39,288 --> 01:40:42,024
It's about hurting like
you've never hurt before

1547
01:40:42,058 --> 01:40:44,894
And finding more in you.

1548
01:40:44,927 --> 01:40:47,730
Now, when the final whistle goes
and we've won,

1549
01:40:47,764 --> 01:40:50,299
You can look at your teammates
in the eye,

1550
01:40:50,332 --> 01:40:52,769
Knowing that you went
that extra yard.

1551
01:40:52,802 --> 01:40:54,871
Now don't let yourselves down!

1552
01:40:54,904 --> 01:40:56,372
Don't let Chang down!

1553
01:40:56,405 --> 01:41:01,210
Get out there!
Get out there!

1554
01:41:03,345 --> 01:41:04,546
The boundary throw-in.

1555
01:41:04,580 --> 01:41:06,949
Wallace with the tap-down.
Gibson over the top.

1556
01:41:06,983 --> 01:41:09,318
Scotty Hyde
bangs through another!

1557
01:41:09,351 --> 01:41:10,920
That's four goals to Hyde.

1558
01:41:10,953 --> 01:41:12,855
All the Tigers need now
is a spark.

1559
01:41:12,889 --> 01:41:14,290
They're right back in this.

1560
01:41:14,323 --> 01:41:15,925
Sully wins the tap,
down to Shore,

1561
01:41:15,958 --> 01:41:18,227
Then Baker in turn,
who kicks long.

1562
01:41:18,291 --> 01:41:20,260
With this one score here, it
could well and truly be over.

1563
01:41:20,293 --> 01:41:22,830
A great intercepted pass
by Fields, however.

1564
01:41:22,863 --> 01:41:25,298
He passes on to Barber,
chips it over to Glenn Hyde,

1565
01:41:25,332 --> 01:41:26,934
Who picks it up,
and he's off.

1566
01:41:26,967 --> 01:41:28,969
He handballs over the top
to Cordy.

1567
01:41:29,002 --> 01:41:30,437
Cordy in turn
gives it back to him.

1568
01:41:30,470 --> 01:41:32,806
Go long!

1569
01:41:32,840 --> 01:41:34,141
Scotty Hyde's on a lead.

1570
01:41:34,174 --> 01:41:36,043
The big question is
will he spot him.

1571
01:41:36,076 --> 01:41:37,444
Use your fucking brother!

1572
01:41:38,946 --> 01:41:40,313
Glenn kicks.

1573
01:41:41,815 --> 01:41:43,250
He's got it!

1574
01:41:43,283 --> 01:41:45,285
What a play
by the Hyde brothers.

1575
01:41:45,318 --> 01:41:48,088
Those boys have played
tremendously well today.

1576
01:41:49,289 --> 01:41:49,990
Scotty, listen up.

1577
01:41:50,023 --> 01:41:52,125
This could turn the game.

1578
01:41:52,159 --> 01:41:55,395
If you kick it through
the middle, we'll get a goal.

1579
01:41:55,428 --> 01:41:57,297
Okay?

1580
01:42:03,503 --> 01:42:06,473
All the pressure in the world
on this young man's shoulders.

1581
01:42:06,506 --> 01:42:09,109
He governs the entire destiny
of the side.

1582
01:42:09,142 --> 01:42:10,878
Very purposely walks in

1583
01:42:10,911 --> 01:42:13,213
And very deliberately
kicks the goal!

1584
01:42:13,246 --> 01:42:16,116
A goal! A goal!

1585
01:42:17,851 --> 01:42:19,787
They've done it!

1586
01:42:22,222 --> 01:42:23,991
Nice one, Scotty!

1587
01:42:24,024 --> 01:42:26,026
That's my boy!

1588
01:42:26,059 --> 01:42:27,828
Come on, boys,
get it done!

1589
01:42:27,861 --> 01:42:28,962
Yes!

1590
01:42:28,996 --> 01:42:30,764
We did it!

1591
01:42:52,319 --> 01:43:00,027
Ohh...

1592
01:43:00,060 --> 01:43:03,263
♪ We're from Tigerland

1593
01:43:03,296 --> 01:43:07,167
♪ A fighting fury
We're from Tigerland ♪

1594
01:43:07,200 --> 01:43:10,337
♪ In any weather
you will see us with a grin ♪

1595
01:43:10,370 --> 01:43:12,139
♪ Risking head and skin

1596
01:43:12,172 --> 01:43:13,573
♪ If we're behind,
we'll never mind ♪

1597
01:43:13,606 --> 01:43:15,042
♪ We'll fight and fight
and win ♪

1598
01:43:15,075 --> 01:43:17,244
♪ Oh, we're from Tigerland

1599
01:43:17,277 --> 01:43:21,281
♪ We never weaken
till the final siren sounds ♪

1600
01:43:21,314 --> 01:43:23,283
♪ Like the Tigers of old

1601
01:43:23,316 --> 01:43:24,952
♪ We're strong and we're bold

1602
01:43:24,985 --> 01:43:26,553
♪ Oh, we're from Tiger

1603
01:43:26,586 --> 01:43:27,988
♪ Yellow and black

1604
01:43:28,021 --> 01:43:31,024
♪ Oh, we're from Tigerland

1605
01:43:56,042 --> 01:43:59,042
<i>:: Re-synchronisation ferneiva ::
